      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARROW TIME (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 2 length fourth (22.75) over 390m at Ballarat. Form from his last run is proving strong. Rates on top in this line up. DR. BENJI (6) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (24.76) at Sale in a Maiden. Can turn it around this time. RUNWAY JADE (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.50) at this track behind Dr. Honey in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. TOFFEE RUPEE (3) should be in the finish fresh from a 11 weeks break.",
